      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.eustathius.budge:31-56",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉϥϫⲱ ⲙⲙⲟⲥ ϫⲉⲛⲣⲱⲙⲉ . ϯⲛⲁⲩ ϫⲉⲉⲣⲉⲡⲉ**ⲥϭⲏⲣ** ⲛⲁϣⲱⲡⲉ ϩⲛⲟⲩⲙⲕⲁϩ ⲙⲛⲟⲩⲛⲟϭ ⲛⲟⲥⲉ . ⲟⲩ ⲙⲟⲛⲟⲛ ⲙⲡϫⲟⲉⲓ ⲙⲛⲡⲁⲩⲉⲓⲛ ⲁⲗⲗⲁ ⲛⲉⲛⲕⲉⲯⲩⲭⲏ .",
      "english": "and said to them, 'Sirs, I perceive that the voyage will be with injury and much loss, not only of the cargo and the ship, but also of our lives.'",
      "source": "44_Acts of the Apostles_27",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.acts.sahidica:27",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
